{"url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mint-disk-cleaner-organizer/id6762415711?mt=12","retrievedAt":"2026-10-21T21:47:03.856Z","title":"‎Mint: Disk Cleaner & Organizer App - App Store","text":"for Mac \nSearch\nDiscover\nArcade\nCreate\nWork\nPlay\nDevelop\nCategories\nCategories\nCategories\nProductivity\nUtilities\nPhoto & Video\nGames\nBusiness\nEducation\nMusic\nSocial Networking\nMint: Disk Cleaner & Organizer\n\nFree up space, find duplicates\n\nOnly for Mac\n\nFree · In‑App Purchases\n\nView in Mac App Store\nAGE RATING\n4+\nYears\nCATEGORY\nUtilities\nDEVELOPER\nDZG STUDIO LLC\nLANGUAGE\nEN\n+ 12 More\nSIZE\n24.1\nMB\nMac\n\nFree to use. Scan your Mac and organize files at no cost, and clean up to 1 GB free. Monthly or Lifetime unlocks unlimited cleanup and Auto Care.\n\nMake room for what matters. Mint helps you understand disk usage and organize the folders you choose on your Mac.\n\nDISK\nExplore the storage map, open a category, and review individual cleanup candidates before approving an action. Keep your selections as you switch filters.\n\nOPTIMIZABLE\nSome files sit on your Mac twice. Mint finds the identical ones and lets them share a single copy of their storage. Nothing is deleted and nothing moves: each file keeps its name, its folder and its contents, and the space comes back. You pick which copies to optimize.\n\nORGANIZE\nChoose a folder, preview the proposed moves, and decide when to apply them. File moves are logged and can be undone while the original items remain available. Mint explains when a folder needs access.\n\nYOUR FOLDERS, YOUR CHOICE\nChoose an individual folder or Home folder access for a more complete scan. Mint scans supported locations that macOS allows. Full Disk Access is optional for protected locations and does not replace folder authorization. You can expand your scan scope later.\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\nScanning and organization run on your Mac. No Mint account is required.\n\nFREE TO USE\nMint is free to download and free to keep. Scanning and organizing your files by hand are free with no limit, and what you clean or optimize during setup is on us. After that, clean up to 1 GB for free; the top bar shows how much is left.\n\nUNLIMITED: MONTHLY OR LIFETIME\nMonthly or Lifetime removes the 1 GB limit and turns on Auto Care, which keeps the folders and Disk types you choose tidy on a schedule. Monthly renews automatically until cancelled in your Apple account. Lifetime is a one-time purchase. Buying Lifetime does not cancel an existing monthly subscription; manage it with Apple to stop renewals. Prices are shown before you buy.\n\nTerms of Use: https://mintstorage.app/terms#app-store\nPrivacy Policy: https://mintstorage.app/privacy\nmore\n\nRatings & Reviews\nThis app hasn’t received enough ratings or reviews to display an overview.\nClean, simple, and it just works\nSep 21\nmarshmallow339\n\nGreat at organizing files and freeing up storage. The design is clean and easy to use: gets the job done in a simple and efficient way.\n\nWhat’s New\n\nMint is now free to use: no trial, no paywall at launch.\n• Scanning and organizing your files by hand are free, with no limit.\n• Setup is on us: what you clean or optimize while setting up is free.\n• Clean up to 1 GB for free. The top bar shows how much is left.\n• Monthly or Lifetime removes the limit and turns on Auto Care.\n\nVersion 1.0.84\nOct 7\nApp Privacy\n\nThe developer, DZG STUDIO LLC, indicated that the app’s privacy practices may include handling of data as described below. For more information, see the developer’s privacy policy .\n\nData Not Linked to You\n\nThe following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\n\nIdentifiers\nUsage Data\nDiagnostics\n\nPrivacy practices may vary, for example, based on the features you use or your age. Learn More\n\nAccessibility\n\nThe developer has not yet indicated which accessibility features this app supports. Learn More\n\nInformation\nSeller\nDZG Studio LLC\nSize\n24.1 MB\nCategory\nUtilities\nCompatibility\nRequires macOS 14.0 or later. \nLanguages\nEnglish and 12 more \nAge Rating\n4+ \nIn-App Purchases\nYes \nCopyright\n© 2026 DZG Studio LLC\nDeveloper Website\nPrivacy Policy\nUnited States\nEspañol (México)\nالعربية\nРусский\n简体中文\nFrançais (France)\n한국어\nPortuguês (Brazil)\nTiếng Việt\n繁體中文 (台灣)\n\nCopyright © 2026 Apple Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nInternet Service Terms\nApp Store & Privacy\nCookie Warning\nSupport","images":[{"src":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/23/fd/dc/23fddcb2-1380-f50d-8649-e5c851781c2c/Placeholder.mill/400x400Icon.ApSmac01-75.webp","alt":"","width":200,"height":200},{"src":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/23/fd/dc/23fddcb2-1380-f50d-8649-e5c851781c2c/Placeholder.mill/400x400Icon.ApSmac01-75.webp","alt":"","width":200,"height":200},{"src":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/91/e4/61/91e461e4-ec59-0d3b-43e4-e7cdf77da4ff/0717b7dc-93c8-42da-9886-e0de0c534f2a.png/96x96bb.webp","alt":"","width":33,"height":48},{"src":"https://apps.apple.com/assets/images/video-control/video-control-play.png","alt":"Play","width":56,"height":56},{"src":"https://apps.apple.com/assets/images/video-control/video-control-volume-muted.png","alt":"Mute","width":56,"height":56},{"src":"https://apps.apple.com/assets/images/video-control/video-control-fullscreen.png","alt":"Fullscreen","width":56,"height":56},{"src":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/aa/93/7b/aa937b97-d99a-b203-ce92-dd6e79ab64a1/02-map.png/1286x804bb.webp","alt":"","width":643,"height":402},{"src":"","alt":"","width":0,"height":0},{"src":"","alt":"","width":0,"height":0}],"links":[{"text":" iPhone ","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/iphone/today"},{"text":" iPad ","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/ipad/today"},{"text":" Mac ","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/mac/discover"},{"text":" Vision ","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/vision/apps-and-games"},{"text":" Watch